<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Phase 1 test artifact for WINDOWS11_AUDIT_MODE_SYSPREP_PLAN.md - NOT the real Windows 11
  unattend.xml (that's unattend-windows11.xml, unchanged). This file exists only to answer
  the plan's single biggest open question: does this project's already-proven offline-drop
  delivery mechanism (%WINDIR%\Panther\unattend.xml) also trigger Audit Mode, the same way it
  already triggers the specialize/oobeSystem passes (Session 9/Finding 34)?

  Deliberately minimal per the plan's Phase 1 spec: only the Microsoft-Windows-Deployment
  Reseal/Mode=Audit setting, nothing else (no RunSynchronous, no driver commands, no
  ComputerName/OOBE-skip/AutoLogon settings from the real template). A clean pass/fail signal,
  not a working build artifact.

  Reseal is documented as valid ONLY under auditSystem/auditUser/oobeSystem passes - NOT
  specialize (confirmed directly from https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/
  customize/desktop/unattend/microsoft-windows-deployment-reseal, "Valid Configuration Passes").
  Placed under oobeSystem here since that's this project's own proven pass for other
  oobeSystem-scoped settings.

  ForceShutdownNow deliberately omitted (defaults false) so this matches the plan's own Phase 1
  methodology exactly: per the Reseal doc's results table, oobeSystem+Audit+ForceShutdownNow=false
  processes the (empty) oobeSystem pass and starts the auditSystem pass in the same boot session,
  landing on a real Administrator desktop with no shutdown in between - watched live via QMP
  screendump (tools/qmp-watch.sh), the same technique proven throughout this project, rather than
  inferring success indirectly from a self-shutdown.
-->
<unattend xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:unattend">
  <settings pass="oobeSystem">
    <component name="Microsoft-Windows-Deployment" processorArchitecture="amd64" publicKeyToken="31bf3856ad364e35" language="neutral" versionScope="nonSxS" xmlns:wcm="http://schemas.microsoft.com/WMIConfig/2002/State" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
      <Reseal>
        <Mode>Audit</Mode>
      </Reseal>
    </component>
  </settings>
</unattend>
